# .cursorrules — railtech.uz (v2 «Мост»)
# Single sources of truth — read before changing anything:
#   AGENTS.md            rules for AI agents (golden rules, workflows, commands)
#   docs/ARCHITECTURE.md pages, data model, components, lead flow to the RailTech CRM / Cabinet
#   docs/DESIGN.md       tokens, components, phone layout, accessibility
# Key rules: no text in code (src/data/cms, src/content); industry-neutral positioning; RU-first stage
# (src/data/content-stage.json) — do not translate until the owner approves the Russian site;
# one menu (src/utils/nav.ts); run `make check` (and `make e2e` for code changes) before a PR; never push to main.
